  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_6143.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La sala&nbsp;La Cassola de Onda ha aogido este lunes una charla sobre Conceptos b&aacute;sicos, factura el&eacute;ctrica y ahorro en la vivienda, a cargo de Jos&eacute; Luis Gandia. La organizaban Caritas Diocesana y la Fundaci&oacute;n para la Eficiencia Energ&eacute;tica, y el Club de la Energ&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6118.jpg\" alt=\"img_6118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6120.jpg\" alt=\"img_6120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6122.jpg\" alt=\"img_6122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6125.jpg\" alt=\"img_6125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6127.jpg\" alt=\"img_6127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6128.jpg\" alt=\"img_6128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6131.jpg\" alt=\"img_6131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritaseifcienciaenergetica/img_6132.jpg\" alt=\"img_6132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritasei